    I --> J[Growing phase acquire]
    I --> K[Shrinking phase release]
    I --> L[Strict 2PL]
    I --> M[Rigorous 2PL]

    N[Deadlock] --> O[Detection wait-for graph]
    N --> P[Prevention timeout]
    N --> Q[Victim selection]

    C --> R[TS ordering]
    R --> S[Wound-wait]
    R --> T[Wait-die]

    D --> U[Read phase]
    D --> V[Validation phase]
    D --> W[Write phase]

    E --> X[Snapshot Isolation]
